OL,3,AWoman found dead in burning van was
OL,4,Apregnant, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman found dead in a burning van was
OL,7,Fpregnant, police have confirmed.
OL,9,FThe body of Samantha Natalie Phythian,
OL,10,F35, was discovered in the vehicle in
OL,11,FPrestatyn, Denbighshire, on Sunday
OL,12,Fevening.
OL,14,FOn Friday it was revealed in a court
OL,15,Fhearing that Samantha, from Rhyl, was
OL,16,Falive when the fire started.
OL,18,FThomas Bell, 38, from Wellington Road
OL,19,Fin Rhyl, appeared in Mold Crown Court
OL,20,Fcharged with murder and was remanded in
OL,21,Fcustody.
